{
  "name": "PIXEL DEX AI 建議討論（Webhook → AI Agent＋Memory）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PIXEL DEX × n8n：AI 建議討論（含記憶）\n網站 .env 設 `AI_PROVIDER=n8n` 時，圖鑑頁的「AI 建議討論」會 POST：\n`{ \"sessionId\": \"瀏覽器每天一個\", \"chatInput\": \"（在看 皮卡丘）對戰建議…\", \"system\": \"系統提示（含目前這隻的 PokeAPI 資料）\" }`\n\n1. 「OpenAI Chat Model」：Credential 選 **OpenAI**（API Key；自架／相容服務把 Base URL 填 `…/v1`），Model 用 By ID 打名字\n2. 「Simple Memory」：Session Key＝sessionId，同一個瀏覽器同一天＝同一段記憶（換寶可夢也接得上）\n   ⚠ Simple Memory 存在 n8n 記憶體，n8n 重開就清空；要長久保存換成 **Postgres Chat Memory**（Session Key 一樣填 `{{ $json.sessionId }}`）\n3. 右上 **Active** 打開，Production URL 填到網站 `.env`：`N8N_CHAT_WEBHOOK_URL=`\n\nAI Agent 可以再接 Tool 節點（查資料、算傷害…），最後回傳 `{ \"text\": \"回答\" }` 就好。",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "6a1e3c5b-7d9f-4b2a-8c4e-0f6b8d2a4c21",
      "name": "說明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "pokedex-chat",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1c3e5a7b-9d2f-4e6a-b8c1-3d5f7a9b1c22",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "4e6a8c0b-2d4f-4a6c-9e1b-5f7d9b1d3e23"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst messages = (Array.isArray(body.messages) ? body.messages : [])\n  .filter((m) => m && (m.role === 'user' || m.role === 'assistant') && m.content)\n  .slice(-12);\nconst last = messages[messages.length - 1];\nconst prompt = String(body.chatInput || (last && last.role === 'user' ? last.content : '') || '請給這隻寶可夢的對戰建議');\n// body.system 是網站組好的系統提示（角色、規則、目前這隻的 PokeAPI 資料）；想自己寫就改這裡\nlet system = body.system || `你是寶可夢對戰與培育的顧問。圖鑑資料：${JSON.stringify(body.pokemon || {})}`;\nlet sessionId = String(body.sessionId || '').trim();\nif (!sessionId) {\n  const earlier = messages.slice(0, -1);\n  if (earlier.length) {\n    system += '\\n\\n先前的對話（接著這段回答）：\\n' +\n      earlier.map((m) => `${m.role === 'user' ? '訓練家' : '顧問'}：${m.content}`).join('\\n');\n  }\n  sessionId = `once-${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}`;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { sessionId, system, prompt } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "8b0d2f4a-6c8e-4a1c-b3d5-7f9b1d3f5a24",
      "name": "整理對話",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.prompt }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "={{ $json.system }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "3f5b7d9a-1c3e-4b5d-8f7a-9c1e3a5c7e25",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000,
          "maxRetries": 0
        }
      },
      "id": "0e2a4c6e-8b0d-4f2a-9c4e-6b8d0f2a4c30",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        400,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sessionIdType": "customKey",
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.sessionId }}",
        "contextWindowLength": 12
      },
      "id": "c4e6a8c0-2d4f-4b6a-8e0c-2a4c6e8a0c31",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        580,
        240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const r = $input.first().json;\nconst text = String(r.output || r.text || '').trim(); // AI Agent 的回答在 output\nif (!text) return [{ json: { ok: false, source: 'n8n', text: 'AI 沒有回答（可能想太久被截斷），再問一次試試' } }];\nreturn [{ json: { ok: true, source: 'n8n', text } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "5d7f9b1c-3e5a-4c7e-a9b2-1d3f5b7d9f26",
      "name": "取出回答",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "firstIncomingItem",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7f9b1d3e-5a7c-4e9a-b1c3-3f5d7f9b1a27",
      "name": "回傳回答",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const e = $input.first().json;\nconst msg = (e.error && (e.error.message || e.error.description)) || e.message || JSON.stringify(e).slice(0, 200);\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, source: 'n8n', text: `n8n 呼叫 AI 失敗：${msg}` } }];\n"
      },
      "id": "9b1d3f5a-7c9e-4a1b-83d5-5a7c9e1b3d28",
      "name": "AI 失敗",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
